timeline: 1
# The key events of the Marvel Cinematic Universe's story, in story order; the full story is in ../marvel-universe/.
# Only what happens in the story world: no release dates, castings or studio news.
# Time runs left to right but the dates mean nothing: each box is as long as its label needs, and a box starts after the events it follows from.
# Boxes that belong together share a row, end to end; a group that no longer fits across continues in a new block of rows below, one empty row apart.
# A connection leads from an event to one that follows from it.
